    "intro_narrative": "Rain lashes against the windows of the precinct. You are Detective Miller, and you've been staring at the evidence board for hours. The notorious 'Phantom' syndicate has left behind a tangled web of encrypted files, burner phones, and fragmented records scattered across the city. Every piece of evidence is a fragment of a larger puzzle. To uncover the identity of the syndicate's leader, you must carefully trace the flow of information, cross-referencing ledgers, maps, and digital artifacts. Your objective is clear: navigate this chaotic trail of breadcrumbs, piece together the timeline, and finally decode the Final Case Report to expose the truth before the trail goes cold.",
